IT WAS THIS LARGER RELATIONSHIP

00:08:32.405 --> 00:08:34.607
AND SITUATION HAPPENING AND THIS

00:08:34.608 --> 00:08:35.441
IS CERTAINLY NOT EITHER THE

00:08:35.442 --> 00:08:38.077
MONARCHS OR THE PRIME MINISTER'S

00:08:38.078 --> 00:08:38.677
FIRST RODEO.

00:08:38.678 --> 00:08:39.945
THE OFFICE OF THE PRIME MINISTER

00:08:39.946 --> 00:08:41.380
AND FOR EVERYONE TO REDUCE IT TO

00:08:41.381 --> 00:08:44.049
JUST AGAIN THAT SALACIOUS NATURE

00:08:44.050 --> 00:08:46.619
I THINK MISSES THE WHOLE POINT.

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:47.686
IT'S ABOUT SOMETHING SO MUCH

00:08:47.687 --> 00:08:48.020
LARGER.

00:08:48.021 --> 00:08:51.457
BACK TO MY POINT YESTERDAY, YES

00:08:51.458 --> 00:08:53.292
HE IS BENEATH THE OFFICE AND NOT

00:08:53.293 --> 00:08:55.060
AT THE SAME LEVEL AS THE HEAD OF

00:08:55.061 --> 00:08:56.962
STATE BUT IT'S A MISSED

00:08:56.963 --> 00:08:58.197
OPPORTUNITY GIVEN AND 2016 HE

00:08:58.198 --> 00:09:01.101
SAID HE WOULD LOVE TO SHOW THEN

